; In-tunnel zone for .xinus names. Rewritten by archangeld when the
; operator pushes a signed name manifest from /gateway. The numbers below
; are placeholders; bring up your wg0 with .1 of the pool to match the
; gateway record.

$ORIGIN xinus.
$TTL 60

@           IN  SOA  ns.xinus. operator.xinus. (
                    1 ; serial — bumped on every reload
                    60
                    60
                    3600
                    60 )
@           IN  NS   ns.xinus.
ns          IN  A    10.42.0.1
gateway     IN  A    10.42.0.1
tesseract   IN  A    10.42.0.1
